sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Browser
    participant GH as GitHub Pages<br/>(deeradio.uk/blast.html)
    participant CF as Cloudflare Worker<br/>(blast-status.workers.dev)
    participant BR as blastradio.com

    User->>GH: Opens blast.html
    GH-->>User: Returns static HTML/JS

    Note over User: JavaScript runs, calls Worker

    User->>CF: GET ?handle=deepspaceradio,getrocked,richpasternack

    par For each handle (parallel)
        CF->>BR: GET /deepspaceradio
        BR-->>CF: HTML page (~350KB)
        CF->>CF: Parse embedded JSON,<br/>extract state + URLs
    and
        CF->>BR: GET /getrocked
        BR-->>CF: HTML page
        CF->>CF: Parse
    and
        CF->>BR: GET /richpasternack
        BR-->>CF: HTML page
        CF->>CF: Parse
    end

    CF-->>User: JSON response<br/>[{state:"live", url:"..."}, ...]

    Note over User: Page renders status badges,<br/>play buttons become active

    User->>BR: Audio stream (direct)<br/>https://broadcast.blastradio.com/{id}.mp3
    Note over User,BR: Audio plays directly from Blast —<br/>Worker not involved in streaming
